id: dead-link
name: Dead-Link
kind: signature
side: disadvantages
tpCost: -6
requirement: This Signature Technique does not have the Twin-Link Advantage for your chosen Combat Roll.
requires: !same-roll:twin-linked
choose: roll
choices: strike, wound
summary: The chosen roll is made twice; the lower counts.
description: >
  The technique has a less consistent and weaker Strike or Wound value.
text: >
  Dead-Link: The technique has a less consistent and weaker Strike or Wound value.
  –TP Cost: -6
  –Requirement: This Signature Technique does not have the Twin-Link Advantage for your chosen Combat Roll.
  –Effect: Choose Strike or Wound. When making the selected Combat Roll, roll it a second time and use the lower Dice Score of the two rolls.

---

# No script: what this does is read where the Technique is built or the attack is rolled
# (module/technique.mjs, module/signature.mjs). See the plan's feature table.
